@baseUrl = http://localhost:5032
@medxToken = REPLACE_WITH_MEDX_JWT

### Get complete final patient data (all database fields, original column names)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Patient/getPatientdetailsFinalFullByDailyno?dailyNo=DR261106-0001
Authorization: Bearer {{medxToken}}

### Missing record: 404; duplicate dailyNo: 409
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Patient/getPatientdetailsFinalFullByDailyno?dailyNo=NONEXISTENT_TEST_DAILYNO
Authorization: Bearer {{medxToken}}

### Missing dailyNo: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Patient/getPatientdetailsFinalFullByDailyno
Authorization: Bearer {{medxToken}}

### Partial update. Omitted or null fields retain their current values.
# Requires exactly one final record and one input record for each inputtype 1 and 2.
# userId is taken from JWT; inputType and userId are not request parameters.
# dateReceived omitted/null retains its current value, never defaults to the current time.
# Zero, empty strings and empty arrays are written. centreId cannot be changed through this API.
# Dates preserve the supplied wall-clock time, without timezone conversion.
# After local commit, enabled formtype rules select LIS, CRM or both.
# No queue creation or remote creation. LIS requires confirmed prior synchronization.
# CRM queued pending/succeeded/failed/unknown records use updateOnly=true.
# CRM 404 NOT_FOUND is skipped and recorded as failed with diagnostics, never created.
# No rule / missing queue / in_progress are skipped.
# One target failure does not stop another. Inspect syncResults; lisSync remains for compatibility.
# Remote failures return 502, state/rule failures 500, with localDatabaseUpdated=true.
# One matching LIS sync record with sync_status=succeeded, or unknown with remote_record_id=centreid,
# triggers automatic token retrieval,
# PATCH UpdateOrder, then PATCH UpdateOrderPatient with the nested patient object.
# No record, in_progress, or another ineligible state returns 200 with lisSync.status=skipped.
# LIS failure returns 502 and localDatabaseUpdated=true; the queue is marked unknown when possible.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Patient/updatePatientdetailsFinalByDailyno
Authorization: Bearer {{medxToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dailyNo": "DR261106-0001",
  "formType": "DR",
  "patientNameEn": "TEST PATIENT",
  "patientNameChi": null,
  "gender": "F",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-02T00:00:00+08:00",
  "age": 36,
  "hkidNo": null,
  "passportNo": null,
  "mobile": null,
  "refCustOrDr": "DOC",
  "patientRefNo": null,
  "billToCustOrDr": "BILL",
  "speciment": "Blood",
  "remarks": null,
  "dateReceived": "2026-11-06T09:00:00+08:00",
  "dateCollected": "2026-11-06T08:00:00+08:00",
  "gestationalWeek": null,
  "gestationalDay": null,
  "pregnancy": null,
  "ethnicOrigin": null,
  "productCode": ["TEST01"],
  "ivf": 0,
  "redo": null,
  "hxOfAbortion": 0,
  "hold": 0,
  "tbc": 0
}

### Update only remarks; all other patient fields retain their current values
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Patient/updatePatientdetailsFinalByDailyno
Authorization: Bearer {{medxToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dailyNo": "DR261106-0001",
  "formType": "DR",
  "remarks": "Updated remarks"
}

### Invalid selector: 400 without database updates
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Patient/updatePatientdetailsFinalByDailyno
Authorization: Bearer {{medxToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dailyNo": " ",
  "formType": "DR"
}
